Subject: [PATCH 0793/3799] soh: rename func_800A63CC -> Skin_DrawAll

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the full-passthrough Skin_DrawImpl wrapper, exposing every parameter (the in-tree comment says "allows specifying all variables"). Named for the wrapper's shape rather than observed behaviour, since arg6 and drawFlags remain unidentified.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_skin.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
